<Episode>
<Section type="report" startTime="0" endTime="1013.705">
<Turn startTime="0" endTime="16.671" speaker="spk1">
<Sync time="0"/>
*Bueno** na:nah *este** ekintsi:n tiknekiskiah xte:chtapowi ke:ní:w teh timoskaltih ke:man katka tipili
<Sync time="7.988"/>
E..., ke:ní:w mitschi:walisne:xtilihkeh 
<Sync time="11.961"/>
wa:n nochi tein tiwelik mocha:n ox tiksentoka tiksentoka tikchi:wa *hasta** a:xka:n 
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="16.671" endTime="71.153">
<Sync time="16.671"/>
Niksentoka, nikchi..., nimotixilia, nimotapa:kia,
<Sync time="23.357"/>
nikahfe:nkwe:chowa, nikahfe:mana, nitapalo:lchi:wa, nikwahkwawiti
<Sync time="31.109"/>
nimo..., miak *cosas** ihkó:n nikchi:wa, teisá: nimokwi:li:ti 
<Sync time="36.566"/>
nochi nikchi:wa ke:meh ne: nocha:n nietoya *cuando** katka nipili.
<Sync time="43.134"/>
Komo onkaya teisá: ompa nik..., ne: ne:chnawatia:yah mah niknamaka pahpata *o** teisá: kahfe:n, *panela**.
<Sync time="52.764"/>
Mah nitanamaka nietok pos nikchi:waya pos ta: katka nipili wa:n no:pa:wa:n ne:chnawatia:yah
<Sync time="62.217"/>
entó:s niksen..., niksentokatok *hasta** a:man a:mo, a:mo nikelka:wa *porque** niwe:i a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="71.153" endTime="75.448">
<Sync time="71.153"/>
Ton chiwalismeh ti..., tiwelik ke:man katka tipili.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="75.448" endTime="99.914">
<Sync time="75.448"/>
Pos pe:wak nimotixilia, pe:wak nikchi:wa tapalo:l, ne:chnawatia:yah,
<Sync time="80.385"/>
mah n'chi:wa tapalo:l, no:má:n yowi ka:sá:, neh nietok a, neh n'chi:wa ya.
<Sync time="85.504"/>
Ne:chili:s chi:wa se: tapial, xikmikti se: piotsi:n wa:n x'chi:wa, niehkos yetok a, pos nikchi:wa.
<Sync time="92.382"/>
Ehko etok a tapalo:l. Etok a taxkal, nitisi a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="99.914" endTime="105.157">
<Sync time="99.914"/>
Ton tapalo:lmeh tiwelik ke:man katka tipili wa:n ke:ní:w tikchihchi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="105.157" endTime="128.636">
<Sync time="105.157"/>
Miak taman tapalo:l, nik..., nikchi:waya, 'chihchi:waya se: pio *mole** oso a:ko:loh, chi:lposo:n,
<Sync time="113.209"/>
nikchi:waya tapalo:l, emo:l tatsoyo:n, a:ko:loh.
<Sync time="119.271"/>
Nochi nikchi:waya chi:lato:lemo:l, tikchi:wah, xokoyo:lemo:l. Neh nochi nikchi:wa tein ne:chnawatia:yah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="128.636" endTime="132.829">
<Sync time="128.636"/>
Ke:ní:w tikchihchi:wa chi:lato:lemo:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="132.829" endTime="161.696">
<Sync time="132.829"/>
Ika, ika tixti wa:n ika seki xiwtsi:n ata ihkó:n onkak, tiki:xmattos, ¿A:mo?
<Sync time="140.319"/>
Ka:n tiki:xmati, tikiliah te:kwa:nnenepi:lxiwit. Se: 'kwe:cholia sikie:ra se: ma:kwi:l *hojita** wa:n
<Sync time="148.422"/>
se: kipa:tilia tixti emo:l, se: kichi:wa tapalo:l a,
<Sync time="153.208"/>
sakie:ra se: chi:lwa:ktsi:n se: 'kwe:cholia, tapalo:l a katka pero a:man a:mo a:kah kwikwa ok
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="161.696" endTime="167.62">
<Sync time="161.696"/>
Wa:n i:n tikihtowa ne: emo:l a:ko:loh *o** xokoyo:lemo:l, ke:ní:w yeh t'chihchi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="167.62" endTime="214.124">
<Sync time="167.62"/>
Pos nikchihchi:wa xokoyo:lin teko:seh oso yo:n takowal xokoyo:lin, takwa:wak xokoyo:lin tikiliah,
<Sync time="175.748"/>
neh nikchi:wa tapalo:l de xokoyo:lin, onkak yo:n takwa:wak, onkak yo:n seki pa:ti,
<Sync time="182.325"/>
nochi kwaltia se: kichi:wa emo:l soh mah se: kimati ke:ní:w se: kichi:was.
<Sync time="187.702"/>
Se: kita:lia
<Comment desc="aqui lo correcto es kita:lilia"/>
 nakaswiyo, koma:mo se: kipia pos mah se: 'kowati.
<Sync time="198.062"/>
Wa:n ihkó:n teisá: teh tein welitsitsi:n nochi tapalo:l se: kikwi,
<Sync time="208.323"/>
mah nanakat, mah tein se: kahsis se: kichi:wa tapalo:l.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="214.124" endTime="216.874">
<Sync time="214.124"/>
Ke:mah katí:n nanakat kwali se: kinkwa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="216.874" endTime="279.946">
<Sync time="216.874"/>
Pos miak taman nanakat onkak, ista:knanakat se: kichi:wa, kwaltsi:n yemaxtsi:n ata nanakatsi:n mochi:wa
<Sync time="227.837"/>
wa:n xo:no:nanakat nochi *igual** sah, yema:nik, yo:n tikiliah alakcho no: we:lik
<Sync time="237.446"/>
Yo:n ne: tikilwiah nejó:n chi:ltaxkal kwali nanakat, yehwa yo:n chikinte no: we:lik iwa:n emo:l.
<Sync time="252.366"/>
Yehwa ya yo:n ma:tananakat yeh no: taman pero yeh tahtakwa:wak
<Sync time="259.542"/>
yehwa ya ka:walpox no: taman, yeh tihtilaktik, no: tahtakwa:wak nanakat.
<Sync time="266.507"/>
kwaltsi:n we:lik mah tikotan se: 'kochti, we:lik tane:si se: kichihchi:wa ya.
<Sync time="273.468"/>
Se: 'kwe:chilia a:ko:lin wa:n kwali moka:wa ya, kwali tapalo:l a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="279.946" endTime="283.984">
<Sync time="279.946"/>
Nochi yo:n nanakat tein tikinto:ka:yti s..., a:koloh se: kikwa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="283.984" endTime="305.537">
<Sync time="283.984"/>
A:mo nochi, chi:ltaxkal chi:lposo:n, alakcho no: we:lik chi:lposo:n.
<Sync time="290.778"/>
Ista:knanakat kwali se: kitsoyo:nia, ne: xo:no:nanakat no: *igual** koma:mo se: kineki se: kikwa:s a:koloh, tatsoyo:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="305.537" endTime="309.049">
<Sync time="305.537"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Wa:n okseki:n
<Who nb="2"/>
Yehwa
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="309.049" endTime="333.388">
<Sync time="309.049"/>
Yehwa ya yo:n ala:wakseknanakat, yeh kwali se: kikwa tamal, se: kichi:wa tamal.
<Sync time="317.262"/>
Ala:wakseknanakat wa:n yo:n nejó:n okseki nanakat, 
<Sync time="323.753"/>
onkak to:tolko:skat tsi:tsikitsitsi:n, no: onkak wa:n onkak tein wehwei.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="333.388" endTime="338.712">
<Sync time="333.388"/>
I:pa yehwa sah tein tiki:xmattok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="338.712" endTime="359.325">
<Sync time="338.712"/>
Miak nanakat onkak yo:n xopitsa onkak, yo:n seki kiliah tahchino:lnanakat, ne: mochi:wa ka:mpa tachichinowah,
<Sync time="347.93"/>
ka:mpa se: tachichinowa se: eto:ka *o** se: teisá: se: kito:ka chi:l, 
<Sync time="352.596"/>
ompa ixwa chihchi:chi:ltik, no: we:lik, yeh tahchino:lnanakat tikilwiah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="359.325" endTime="362.407">
<Sync time="359.325"/>
Wa:n tahchino:lnanakat ke:ní:w se: kichihchi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="362.407" endTime="366.933">
<Sync time="362.407"/>
Se: kikwa koma:ltamal *o** se: kimana.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="366.933" endTime="378.15">
<Sync time="366.933"/>
A:yoh sah oso chi:lposo:n.
<Sync time="369.093"/>
A:mo, sayoh se: kimana wa:n se: kitsoyo:ni:s, koma:mo se: kichi:wa koma:ltamal kwaltia ika taxkal.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="378.15" endTime="387.862">
<Sync time="378.15"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Wa:n ne:n, ke:ní:w tikihtoh kopitsaknanakat, xopitsananakat
<Who nb="2"/>
Xopitsa, xopitsa, yeh se: 'kwe:chowa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="387.862" endTime="392.775">
<Sync time="387.862"/>
Se: 'kwe:chowa, se: kimolo:ntia wa:n se: kikwa ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="392.775" endTime="394.596">
<Sync time="392.775"/>
¿Alaxtik moka:wa ke:meh tixti?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="394.596" endTime="411.46">
<Sync time="394.596"/>
Ke:mah alaxtik moka:wa, mah se: kalaxo ika metat.
<Sync time="399.126"/>
Pero mah se: kimati kení:w se: kichi:was koma:mo pos iwki se: kimanas, tahtakwaktik, a:mo oksi.
<Sync time="408.651"/>
¿Pos ke:ní:s se: kichi:wa?
<Sync time="409.739"/>
Se: 'kwe:chowa
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="411.46" endTime="414.226">
<Sync time="411.46"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Achto se: kimolo:ntia wa:n sa:te:pan se: 'kwe:chowa.
<Who nb="2"/>
A:mo.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="414.226" endTime="421.747">
<Sync time="414.226"/>

A:mo, se..., seki iwki xohxowik se: 'kwe:chowa, seki se: kimolo:ntia wa:n se: 'kwe:chowa ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="421.747" endTime="424.007">
<Sync time="421.747"/>
Wa:n ke:mah de tikwe:chowa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="424.007" endTime="433.625">
<Sync time="424.007"/>
Pos mah se: kichihchi:wa ya, se: kimolo:nti a, ika, komo ika a:ko:lin iwa:n, komo tatsoyo:n, se: kitsoyo:ni.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="433.625" endTime="437.821">
<Sync time="433.625"/>
I:pa yehwa sah nanakameh
<Comment desc="Aqui por error se pluralizó nanakameh "/>
 tein tikini:xmattok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="437.821" endTime="471.328">
<Sync time="437.821"/>
A:mo ta: onkak miak taman nanakat, yo:n xilwananakat, yo:n no: mochi:wa ka:sá: ika nika:wí: tehwa:n, kowtah,
<Sync time="448.039"/>
in yeh se: kikwa chi:lposo:n.
<Sync time="452.664"/>
Yo:n nimitsilia onkak seki to:tolko:skat wehwei *bolas** mochi:wa, 
<Sync time="459.929"/>
mokehketsa ihkó:n, ka:sá: ika yetok mahyá: ihkó:n se: *bolita**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="471.328" endTime="479.401">
<Sync time="471.328"/>
Wa:n kilmeh tein tikini:xmat ke:man katka tipili nohma onkak ekintsi:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="479.401" endTime="480.473">
<Sync time="479.401"/>
Nohma onkak
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="480.473" endTime="484.322">
<Sync time="480.473"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
No t..., no: tiwelik *desde** tipili tikinchihchi:wa, tikchichi:wa.  
<Who nb="2"/>
Ke:mah, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="484.322" endTime="492.672">
<Sync time="484.322"/>
Ke:meh yo:n metstsonkilit, tikiliah kopitsokilit, wehweikilit, no: niweli.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2 spk1" startTime="492.672" endTime="494.539">
<Sync time="492.672"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
'Kiektia.  
<Who nb="2"/>
 Yeh ke:ní:w se: kichihchi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="494.539" endTime="511.01">
<Sync time="494.539"/>
Yeh se: kiektia, se: 'kwiti ka:mpa onkak wa:n se: kiektia kwaltsi:n, kwaltsi:n wa:n ke:mah se: kimana ya,
<Sync time="504.028"/>
komo se: kita:lilia a:ko:lin, a:ko:lin koma:mo pos iwki sah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="511.01" endTime="513.958">
<Sync time="511.01"/>
Tikihtowa ke: se: kiektia, ki..., toni se: ki:xtilia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="513.958" endTime="519.286">
<Sync time="513.958"/>
Ikowyo, *porque** no: kowyoh, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="519.286" endTime="521.257">
<Sync time="519.286"/>
Wa:n koma:mo se: ki:xtilih n' ikowyo.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="521.257" endTime="528.532">
<Sync time="521.257"/>
Ka:n kwaltia, ka:n kwaltia, se:, kipia de se: kiekti:s, se: kichipa:wa
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="528.532" endTime="531.144">
<Sync time="528.532"/>
Ke:yeh tikilia ke a:mo kwaltia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="531.144" endTime="540.491">
<Sync time="531.144"/>
Pos iwa:n ikowyo a:mo kimanah, i:pa *desde** ti..., ti:xpeta:nkeh, kiektiah tikitayah kiltsi:n wa:n kimanah ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="540.491" endTime="543.562">
<Sync time="540.491"/>
Wa:n komo se: kimanak iwa:n ikowyo
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="543.562" endTime="608.003">
<Sync time="543.562"/>
Pos kihtowah ke ka:n kwaltia, ka:n wel se: kikwa
<Sync time="548.261"/>
mm, *solamente** ke:meh yo:n tomakilit iwa:n ikowyo, wa:wkilit iwa:n ikowyo
<Sync time="555.77"/>
Ke:meh yo:n, to..., yehwa ya ne:n yo:n seki tikiliah ma:kwi:lkilit, tikwihkwitih wa:n tikchihchi:wah 
<Sync time="570.907"/>
tikmanah *o** tikwe:chowah wa:n 'tsoyo:niah, tikwah ya.
<Sync time="578.3"/>
Yehwa ya yo:n okseki ok, miak taman kilit onkak, witskilit
<Sync time="587.019"/>
se: kiteki wa:n se: kimana, yeh kwaltia no: iwa:n ikowyo, we:weyak se: kiteki wa:n se: kimana komo sa sehseltik,
<Sync time="598.081"/>
ke:meh ne: ayohkilit onkak, ne: kwali se: 'kwihkwi ikechyo wa:n se: kimana.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="608.003" endTime="614.443">
<Sync time="608.003"/>
I:pa yehwa sah?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="614.443" endTime="634.46">
<Sync time="614.443"/>
Miak taman *cosas** onkak, ke:meh yo:n kantsili:n, tikiliah tehwa:n witstololoh mexicano,
<Sync time="621.073"/>
witstololoh, se: 'kwiti kowtah wa:n se: kipohposteki, se: kimana kwaltsi:n, se: kichi:lposo:wia, tapalo:l a.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="634.46" endTime="642.119">
<Sync time="634.46"/>
Tehwa:tsi:n ke:man timona:miktih, ¿Mitsihtankeh? 
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="642.119" endTime="643.685">
<Sync time="642.119"/>
Ne:chihtankeh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="643.685" endTime="646.947">
<Sync time="643.685"/>
Ka:ni tiki:xmat mota:totsi:n, mota:tahtsi:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="646.947" endTime="663.12">
<Sync time="646.947"/>
Ka:n teh neh niki:xmattok, tak yehwa tanawatih mah ne:chihtanitih, tak yehwa tanawatihka, a..., am..., a:mo neh niki:xmat, yehwa tanawatih, mm.
<Sync time="660.413"/>
Welis tite:chtapowi:s ke:ní:w mitsihtankeh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="663.12" endTime="667.186">
<Sync time="663.12"/>
Pos ne:chihtankeh *dos años**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="667.186" endTime="675.078">
<Sync time="667.186"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Tiknekiskiah xite:chtapowi nochi ke:ní:w kichi:wkeh, ke:ní:w ne:n tikihtowa mitskalpa:notoh, te:ch..., welis tite:chtapowi:s ne:
<Who nb="2"/>

</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="675.078" endTime="692.706">
<Sync time="675.078"/>
Pos kitahtani:toh no:pa:wa:n ke kinekih mah iwa:n nimota:li n' okichpil, mm. Yeh *cuatro años** ata *comadrita**,
<Sync time="689.641"/>
Neh *dos años**
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="692.706" endTime="702.442">
<Sync time="692.706"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Aha. 'Te:chtapowi nochi tein kichi:wkeh, ke:ní:w kichi:wkeh, a:koni kinohno:tsatoh, ke:ní:w namonohno:tskeh *o** ke:ní:w yehwa:n monohno:tskeh.
<Who nb="2"/>
Pos no..., pos no:, pos no:pa:wa:n, no:pa:wa:n kininnohno:tsatoh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="702.442" endTime="749.286">
<Sync time="702.442"/>
Ke:mah, no:pa:wa:n yahkeh kininohno:tsatoh.
<Sync time="706.568"/>
wa:n yehwa:n kini..., wehka:w a:mo pi:pil kimatiah.
<Sync time="710.274"/>
Wehka:w te:popa:wa:n kimatiah, komo tana:nkili:skeh, tana:nkili:tih wa:n koma:mo, yehwa:n tayo:lohpachowah,
<Sync time="718.073"/>
*menos** ke teh timowelimakas tiá:s sah, mm wa:n no: semi te:ilia:yah 
<Sync time="725.701"/>
komo timitstana:nkilili:tih wa:n a:mo ticholohte:was, ka:sá: ika 'te:tohtokas sah, 
<Sync time="732.656"/>
koma:mo ma:ski a:mo ke:mah xiwi:ki ok.
<Sync time="735.537"/>
Wehka:w iwki katka, a:mo ke:meh a:man, a:man pi:pil tsikitsitsi:n sa tatsikwi:ntok, cholowah, *escuela** ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="749.286" endTime="766.512">
<Sync time="749.286"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Ke:man mitsihtankeh no: k..., no: ki..., kika:watoh ke:meh yo:n seki ka:sá: ika kihtowah ke kininka:wili:tih kowit oso teisá: miak taman.
<Who nb="2"/>
Mm. Ke:mah, ka:ka:wati *novio** kowit *cada ocho dias**, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="766.512" endTime="769.563">
<Sync time="766.512"/>
¿I:pa kowit sah mitsonka:wilia:ya?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="769.563" endTime="794.447">
<Sync time="769.563"/>
Kowit kika:wati yehwa wa:n i..., ita:twa:n oso ikni:wa:n koma:mo teh ita:twa:n, 
<Sync time="775.348"/>
'ka:watih xapoh, teisá: ihkó:n 'ka:watih n' ikni:wa:n.
<Sync time="781.507"/>
Neh nota:tahtsi:n katka sayoh ikni:wa:n kimpiaya, kisiwahtanihkeh, 
<Sync time="786.163"/>
a:mo imomá:n wa:n nió:n no: ipopá:n a:mo nemia ok, ise:lti katka.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="794.447" endTime="798.259">
<Sync time="794.447"/>
Wa:n yeh toni mitska:wili:to.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="798.259" endTime="813.492">
<Sync time="798.259"/>
Pos taka:watoh *cuando** kinina:nkilihkeh.
<Sync time="802.891"/>
Ka:n no: kinekiah no:pa:wa:n kwiskeh, kiliah, tehwa:n a:mo, tame:chna:nkiliah pero a:mo *porque** t'nekih teisá:.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="813.492" endTime="820.622">
<Sync time="813.492"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Niman kina:nkilihkeh mo:pa:wa:n.
<Who nb="2"/>
A:mo, we:hka:wak, wehka:wak.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="820.622" endTime="823.023">
<Sync time="820.622"/>
Ke:meh ka:nachi to:nal mochiakeh.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="823.023" endTime="828.179">
<Sync time="823.023"/>
Xa: ke:meh *tres meses**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="828.179" endTime="834.357">
